m/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/languages","stargazers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/stargazers","contributors_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contributors","subscribers_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscribers","subscription_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/subscription","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-292](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-292)\r\n### Background\r\n\r\nCreating a new Yugabyte cluster initializes YSQL with a snapshot of pre-run `initdb`, which creates and populates system catalogs and does the initial configuration.\r\nStarting with Yugabyte v2.3, we sometimes made changes like inserting rows to systen catalogs, introducing new YB-specific catalogs, installing extensions by default, etc. These changes were applied to `initdb`, so newly created clusters would be initialized to a latest state.\r\nHowever, existing clusters weren’t able to take advantage of the new features.\r\nTo give existing users access to all YSQL-specific features implemented so far and in the future, we introduce a concept of YSQL upgrade.\r\n\r\nYSQL catalog changes are formalized as **migrations** - SQL scripts shipped within YB itself. YSQL upgrade itself applies those migrations sequentially to all databases in the cluster. This is an online operation.\r\nRight now, YSQL upgrade is optional and is invoked through\r\n```\r\n$ ./bin/yb-admin -timeout_ms 180000 upgrade_ysql\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Roadmap\r\n\r\n|  | Feature        | Issue # | Comments |\r\n| :--: | --------------- | ------------------  | ------------------ |\r\n| ✅ | Support creation of system and shared system catalog tables | #2272 | Prerequisite for migrations |\r\n| ✅ | Support creation of system views | #2272 | Prerequisite for migrations |\r\n| ✅ | Support `INSERT` with an OID and ON CONFLICT | #2272 | Prerequisite for migrations |\r\n| ✅ | Migration framework | #2272 | Main feature, enables YSQL upgrade |\r\n| ✅ | Make YSQL upgrade do nothing when YSQL is not enabled | #11206 |\r\n| ✅ | Add YSQL upgrade page in YB documentation | | |\r\n| ✅ | Support limiting upgrade_ysql command to 1 connection | #13364 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Increase priority of upgrade transactions | #13261 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Test system DDLs and YSQL caches with multiple connections |  #12466 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Support `DROP TABLE` | | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Support adding indexes to existing tables | | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Support adding/removing columns | | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Support replacing system views | #13262 | |\r\n\r\n### Bugs\r\n|  | Bug        | Issue # | Comments |\r\n| :--: | --------------- | ------------------  | ------------------ |\r\n| ✅ | Replacing system view is not filtering out upgrade-specific options | #12201 | |\r\n| ✅ | Upgrade doesn't work if YSQL was initialized by a manual initdb run | #13525 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | TestYsqlUpgrade.sharedRelsIndexesWork may fail to find pg_class | #9332 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Upgrading a recent cluster won't create yb_catalog_version function | #10724 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Using `WHERE oid = ...` causes memory allocation warnings | #11105 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | Inserts to pg_depend should update YB pinned object cache | #12307 | |\r\n| ⬜️ | V19 migration is using too much memory | #13458 | |\n\n[DB-292]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-292?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/10651/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":7137289457,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc5PN0HhzwAAAAGpamTx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/7137289457","actor":{"login":"yugabyte-ci","id":17281578,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjgxNTc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17281578?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte-ci","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-08-05T16:52:16Z","label":{"name":"status/awaiting-triage","color":"E33F0D"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":7163780231,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBlCVUc5PN0HhzwAAAAGq_pyH","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/7163780231","actor":{"login":"priyanshi-yb","id":95338382,"node_id":"U_kgDOBa6_jg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95338382?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/priyanshi-yb"